WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.439
Today the sentence tells your child to do something on the page.

2
00:00:03.889 --> 00:00:10.701
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.201 --> 00:00:13.780
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:20.413
First, tell your child one word. Put. It starts every sentence today, and it is not sounded out.

5
00:00:20.863 --> 00:00:22.977
Your child reads the sentence out loud.

6
00:00:23.377 --> 00:00:24.568
Put a hat on the dog.

7
00:00:25.268 --> 00:00:30.806
There are two pictures. A dog, and a cat. Your child finds the dog, and draws a hat on it.

8
00:00:31.256 --> 00:00:35.681
This cannot be done without understanding. And you can see at a glance if it was.

9
00:00:36.131 --> 00:00:40.715
Do not say what to draw. If it goes wrong, say: read it again. What do you see?

10
00:00:41.165 --> 00:00:45.306
For job two, press play on your child's listening track, and step away.

11
00:00:45.756 --> 00:00:52.232
Your child reads each sentence out loud. The voice waits, then reads it, and your child marks the box.

12
00:00:52.682 --> 00:00:57.443
So the words are checked first. Then your child goes back, and does what each sentence says.

13
00:00:57.893 --> 00:01:01.200
That is two reads. One for the words, and one for the meaning.

14
00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:05.691
At the end, your child shows you the page, and reads one sentence to you.
